    "Cost": 53730998,
    "UIName": "Arachnid A",
    "Id": "mechdef_arachnid_ARD-A",
    "Name": "Arachnid A",
    "Details": "The Alpha configuration of the Arachnid aims to provide indirect fire support, while still being able to survive staying near the frontline. Two huge Thunderbolt 20 launchers and four Streak LRM-20 launchers provide an impressive missile volley capability, able to overload even the most advanced anti-missile systems. Two center torso mounted Large ER Pulse Lasers allow some direct fire options as need arises, and a newly designed clan version of the Angel ECM enables electronic warfare support. To free up the weight capacity needed the armor has been converted to the latest Titano-Carbide Lamellor. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Intimidating</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.45</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_arachnid"
  },
